<title>HONG KONG: Salomon appoints Asia Pacific equity capital chief.</title>
<headline>Salomon appoints Asia Pacific equity capital chief.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers announced on Friday the appointment of Sanjiv Misra as managing director and head of Asia Pacific equity capital markets.</p>
<p>He will take up the post in February.</p>
<p>Misra was previously country head of India at Goldman Sachs and Co.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6352</p>
</text>
